#149: FILE: drivers/scsi/eata.c:870:
+	if ((cond)) dev_info((dev), (fmt), ##__VA_ARGS__)

Trailing statements (for example after any conditional) should be
on the next line.
Statements, such as::

  if (x == y) break;

should be::

  if (x == y)
          break;

